{"id": "t069-009", "text": "Juan's long-haul flight to Santiago leaves Saturday at 11pm, nearly fifteen hours with a change in Madrid. His mum is having heart surgery out there next Thursday, so he's going to stay for a month to help his dad. He's trying to work remotely but the time difference will be awful. He sounded exhausted and quite low about the whole thing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "long-haul flight to Santiago", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 11pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearly fifteen hours", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "heart surgery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite low", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t069-010", "text": "Pick up the dry cleaning tomorrow morning before 9.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up the dry cleaning", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning before 9", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-011", "text": "Marcus plays bass in a covers band called The Late Shift, mostly nineties Britpop with the odd Motown number thrown in. They've got a gig at the Crown on Friday at 8pm and he's nervous because it's their first one with a new drummer, who only joined three weeks ago. He's been rehearsing every evening this week. I should go along and support him, and maybe bring Uma.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "plays bass in a covers band called The Late Shift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "nineties Britpop", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Motown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the Crown", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 8pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks ago"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening this week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go along and support him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring Uma", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t069-012", "text": "Uma said her dad retires on 30 June after thirty-one years at the council. The family are throwing him a party the following weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "30 June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
