{"id": "t069-022", "text": "Dorota is flying home to Kraków on 18 December and staying until the 6th of January. She's taking her partner Fern to meet the family for the first time, and Fern is quite nervous about it, especially about Christmas Eve dinner with her grandmother, who speaks no English. Dorota has been teaching her a few Polish phrases in the evenings. I said I'd water their plants while they're away.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying home to Kraków", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the 6th of January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite nervous", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Christmas Eve dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "speaks no English", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the evenings"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're away", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t069-023", "text": "Yetunde is crazy about Formula 1. She's a Ferrari fan, despite everything, and she's going to Silverstone in July.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Formula 1", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ferrari", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Silverstone", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in July", "anchor": "e1"}]}
