{"id": "t069-026", "text": "Siobhan and her husband are celebrating their 25th anniversary with a cruise round the Norwegian fjords in September. They leave from Southampton on the 12th at 4pm and are away for ten nights. It's the first proper holiday they've had since the kids were small. She keeps hinting that they'd love a nice big photo frame for the pictures. Must get a card and a frame before they go.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siobhan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "25th anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cruise round the Norwegian fjords", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th at 4pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "ten nights", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a nice big photo frame", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card and a frame", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before they go", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-027", "text": "Grace has been struggling since the breakup. She says she's fine, but she isn't sleeping. I'll call her tomorrow evening, around 7.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening, around 7"}]}
{"id": "t069-028", "text": "Saskia is running the Berlin Marathon on 27 September. Her training plan is relentless, five runs a week. Ask her for her finish time afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Berlin Marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "27 September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her for her finish time", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
