{"id": "t069-030", "text": "Graham Novak from the climbing wall mentioned he's off to the Dolomites for a fortnight in August. He climbs mostly trad and is keen on the via ferratas out there.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham Novak", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the climbing wall", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to the Dolomites", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in August", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbs mostly trad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "via ferratas", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t069-031", "text": "Amara collects vinyl, mostly seventies soul and Afrobeat. She's looking for an original pressing of Fela Kuti's Zombie, which would make the perfect present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "seventies soul", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Afrobeat", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "looking for an original pressing of Fela Kuti's Zombie", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t069-032", "text": "Lunch with Sam today was lovely. He's been made head of department and starts the new role after Easter. Must send him a card to say congratulations.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made head of department", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Easter", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t069-033", "text": "Kasia's Spanish exam is on 3 June at 9am. She's dreading the oral part. Wish her luck the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Spanish exam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 June at 9am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the oral part", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Wish her luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-034", "text": "Remember to bring the board games to Olivia's on Saturday at 4.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring the board games to Olivia's", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 4", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-035", "text": "Long chat with Jen on the phone tonight. She's thinking of leaving her job at the bank and spending six months travelling around South East Asia, starting in Bangkok in January. Her parents aren't thrilled. She asked if I'd look after her cat Pepper while she's away, and I said probably yes. Her flat lease ends on 31/12, so she has to decide by November whether to renew. I should check in with her next week to see where she's landed.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "job at the bank", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six months", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "travelling around South East Asia", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "aren't thrilled", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while she's away", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flat lease ends", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "31/12", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "by November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-036", "text": "Oisín plays hurling for his local club and has a county semi-final on Sunday afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "hurling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "county semi-final", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t069-037", "text": "Yasmin and her girlfriend have tickets for Taylor Swift in Dublin on 28 June. They're getting the ferry over the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Taylor Swift in Dublin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "28 June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t069-038", "text": "Juan is back from Chile. His mum is recovering slowly but it's been hard on him. Remind me to take Juan out for a pint next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Chile", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovering", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hard on him", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take Juan out for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-039", "text": "Need to renew my passport before the trip in March.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "renew my passport", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t069-040", "text": "Marcus said the gig was cancelled because the drummer broke his wrist. He's gutted. They're trying to rebook for next month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke his wrist", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month"}]}
{"id": "t069-041", "text": "Uma's sister Jaya is getting married in Goa on the 2nd of February. Uma is a bridesmaid and flies out the week before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Goa", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd of February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t069-042", "text": "Femi supports Arsenal and gets very upset after a loss. Avoid football talk on Mondays.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Arsenal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "upset after a loss", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Avoid football talk", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Mondays", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-043", "text": "Leon has his driving test on Friday at 11.15. Third attempt. He's really nervous this time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 11.15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t069-044", "text": "Dev is a keen birdwatcher and is going to Shetland in May to see the puffins at Sumburgh Head. He's been on about it for years and has a whole spreadsheet of species he wants to tick off, including a snowy owl if he's very lucky. He takes the overnight ferry from Aberdeen on 10 May at 5pm. He asked to borrow my good binoculars, so I need to post them to him by the end of April.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "birdwatcher", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Shetland", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "years"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "10 May at 5pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post them to him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of April", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-045", "text": "Eli has started making sourdough and is very serious about it, with a starter named Doughvid.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sourdough", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "starter named Doughvid", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t069-046", "text": "Text Ciara on the 14th to see how Biscuit's stitches are healing.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Ciara", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-047", "text": "Emily's brother Oisín is emigrating to New Zealand in the spring. He's got a job lined up at a hospital in Wellington and flies out on 2 April. Emily is quite upset about it but trying to be positive, and says their mum has been crying every time it comes up. Their whole family is having a farewell dinner on 15 March at 7pm. I should get him a little leaving present, maybe a good travel pillow for the flight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "emigrating to New Zealand", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job lined up at a hospital in Wellington", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 April", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite upset", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to be positive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "crying every time it comes up", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "farewell dinner", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 March at 7pm", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him a little leaving present", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t069-048", "text": "Gemma and her partner have split up, so the trip to Greece they had planned for June is off. She lost the deposit on the hotel too, which made it worse. She's thinking of going on her own instead, maybe to Crete for a week, and doing some hiking in the Samaria Gorge. She seems a bit lost but more upbeat than last time. I should send her the details of that villa we stayed in near Chania.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going on her own", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit lost", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "upbeat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her the details of that villa we stayed in near Chania", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t069-049", "text": "Sort out travel insurance and order some euros before Thursday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Sort out travel insurance", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "order some euros", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Thursday morning", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t069-050", "text": "Mila's grandad died last week. The funeral is on Wednesday at 11am in Cork. Must send a card to her and her mum.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 11am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card to her and her mum", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t069-051", "text": "Ethan has just got into the county youth orchestra on viola. Huge deal for a fourteen-year-old. Congratulate him when I see him on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the county youth orchestra", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "viola", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fourteen-year-old", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Congratulate him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I see him on Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-052", "text": "Jaya got the job at the museum! She starts on 1 September as an assistant curator.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the job at the museum", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "1 September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "assistant curator", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t069-053", "text": "Dorota knits, mostly socks, and says she's finally ready to try a jumper. She'd love some good merino yarn.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knits", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "ready to try a jumper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "love some good merino yarn", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t069-054", "text": "Fern and Dorota's flight to Kraków was moved to 19 December at 6.15am. Fern is not a morning person, so that will be interesting.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight to Kraków", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "19 December at 6.15am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not a morning person", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t069-055", "text": "Yetunde's brother Femi is doing a skydive for charity on 8th July. Remind me to sponsor him before then.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "skydive for charity", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "8th July", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sponsor him", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-056", "text": "Vanessa asked if I could FaceTime her on Sunday at 6pm her time. She's in Vancouver for work until the end of the month and is getting homesick. She's been spending her weekends hiking and went whale watching last Saturday, which she loved. Her husband Marcus and the kids are flying out to join her for the last week, from the 24th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 6pm her time"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "in Vancouver for work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "homesick", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "hiking", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "whale watching", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Saturday"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "from the 24th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t069-057", "text": "Siobhan's son Sam finishes primary school next month and starts at St Patrick's in September. Big change.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siobhan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "primary school", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "St Patrick's", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t069-058", "text": "Grace has booked a solo trip to Morocco from 4 to 11 April. First holiday since the breakup. Ask her afterwards how she found it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "solo trip to Morocco", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from 4 to 11 April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-059", "text": "Spoke to Saskia's husband Leon. Saskia hurt her calf in training and may have to pull out of the marathon. She's devastated. I should give her a ring this week, maybe Thursday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hurt her calf", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "devastated", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "give her a ring", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
